  <!-- FAQ Section (Custom Accordion) -->
  <section class="section-block reveal" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-intro section-intro-stack" style="align-items: center; text-align: center;">
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <p style="max-width: 32rem; text-align: center;">Got questions about GymOS? Find clear answers to common operations and rollout queries here.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-accordion-container" id="faq-list">
        <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
        <div class="faq-item" data-open="true">
          <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="true">
            <span>How does the 14-day free trial work?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">&#8722;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-panel" style="max-height: 200px;">
            <p>You can start a 14-day free trial on any plan during onboarding. No credit card is required for the trial, and the selected plan controls which advanced modules and limits are active while you evaluate the product.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Item 2 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Can I migrate my existing member records?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">&#43;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-panel" style="max-height: 0;">
            <p>Yes. GymOS supports CSV data imports for members, active packages, and remaining balances. Scale is the best fit when you also need branch rollout planning, eSSL setup, and broader operational migration support.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Is there a limit on member registrations?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">&#43;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-panel" style="max-height: 0;">
            <p>Yes, each plan includes an active-member limit. Starter supports up to 300 active members, Growth supports up to 1,200, and Scale supports up to 5,000. Staff and gym-location limits also expand as you move up.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>How are billing alerts and reminders sent?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">&#43;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-panel" style="max-height: 0;">
            <p>Billing reminders and invoice checkout links are automatically dispatched via SMS and WhatsApp integrations. You can toggle automated notifications on or off and customize checkout intervals.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Item 5 -->
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Can I restrict staff from viewing revenue reports?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">&#43;</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-panel" style="max-height: 0;">
            <p>Yes. GymOS features granular role-based permissions. You can disable access to financial reporting, member deletion, or invoice overriding for desk receptionists or fitness trainers, while maintaining full permissions for owners.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-block article-wrap reveal">
    <div class="container" style="text-align: center; padding: 4rem 2rem;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Start Today</span>
      <h2 style="font-size: 2.2rem; max-width: 32rem; margin: 0 auto 1rem auto; font-weight: 850;">Build a highly disciplined gym operation.</h2>
